K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
K ALT-C
S LISTMENU
T O
S OPENED
K ALT-C
S FORMMENU
T W
S USEDWITH
K CTRL-L
S NOLEND
K ALT-C
S NOLENDM
K ESC ESC ALT-C
T S
K ENTER ALT-C
S SVCFORM
